  - "cargo xtask ui e2e — 25 passing, 0 failing across both spec files (6 onboarding + 19 flows). The 19 in flows.spec.ts are UNTOUCHED by this WU and prove the redesign did not regress UC-4 or UC-5; run against the real Tauri window and a real ephemeral core."
